{"3026650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Master Bobber", "steam_appid": 3026650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Embark on a Unique Adventure: Fishing, Hunting, and Unlocking the Secrets of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player adventure game, you'll take on the role of a fisherman on a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hidden lake, where your journey will unfold in unexpected ways. As you catch fish, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll trade them for hunting trips that will test your skills and push you to new </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progression will take you through three distinct hunting experiences: a still </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hunt under the shade of a tree, a thrilling side-by-side shooting adventure, and a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mysterious quest to uncover the origins of life on Earth. In this final hunt, you'll </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build molecular structures and face off against an otherworldly creature, all while </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigating the intricate dance of atoms and molecules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, your ultimate goal is to reach the culmination of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your journey: a heart-pumping escape that will put your skills to the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >test. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls using keyboard and mouse or Xbox-style controller, you'll </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigate the lake, cast your line, and blast through challenges with ease. The game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features two save points, allowing you to pick up where you left off and continue </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive experience is enhanced by realistic sound effects, including voice </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >acting for key events like catching fish or taking down deer. While there's no </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >background music by default, you can manually start the radio and treat yourself to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >custom beats from Beatsaver – which will even make the fish dance to the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Key Features:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Seamless VR integration. Just put on your headset and run the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Unique blend of fishing, hunting, and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Easy one-tap trolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Runs on slower computers with no graphics card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Three distinct hunting experiences with increasing complexity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Molecular structure-building gameplay that simulates the origins of life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Intuitive controls using keyboard and mouse or Xbox-style controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Immersive sound effects and voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Customizable music experience using Beatsaver</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Get ready to reel in the adventure!**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Embark on a Unique Adventure: Fishing, Hunting, and Unlocking the Secrets of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player adventure game, you'll take on the role of a fisherman on a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hidden lake, where your journey will unfold in unexpected ways. As you catch fish, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll trade them for hunting trips that will test your skills and push you to new </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progression will take you through three distinct hunting experiences: a still </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hunt under the shade of a tree, a thrilling side-by-side shooting adventure, and a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mysterious quest to uncover the origins of life on Earth. In this final hunt, you'll </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >build molecular structures and face off against an otherworldly creature, all while </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigating the intricate dance of atoms and molecules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, your ultimate goal is to reach the culmination of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your journey: a heart-pumping escape that will put your skills to the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >test. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls using keyboard and mouse or Xbox-style controller, you'll </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >navigate the lake, cast your line, and blast through challenges with ease. The game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features two save points, allowing you to pick up where you left off and continue </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive experience is enhanced by realistic sound effects, including voice </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >acting for key events like catching fish or taking down deer. While there's no </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >background music by default, you can manually start the radio and treat yourself to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >custom beats from Beatsaver – which will even make the fish dance to the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Key Features:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Seamless VR integration. Just put on your headset and run the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Unique blend of fishing, hunting, and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Easy one-tap trolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Runs on slower computers with no graphics card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Three distinct hunting experiences with increasing complexity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Molecular structure-building gameplay that simulates the origins of life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Intuitive controls using keyboard and mouse or Xbox-style controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Immersive sound effects and voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Customizable music experience using Beatsaver</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Get ready to reel in the adventure!**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Hooked on fun! Fishing &amp; hunting await in Master Bobber.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026650/0bfb1a4ee22a12f5ce45ff9c316556095b50da74/header.jpg?t=1761287822", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026650/046cd4092406a8abf84a6f21a176557a11c7fdec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761287822", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026650/046cd4092406a8abf84a6f21a176557a11c7fdec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761287822", "website": "https://meatygamer.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> celeron<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> onboard<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest 2, Quest 3, Valve Index</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><